# Institutional & governance documents

Place official downloadable files here (PDF, DOCX, etc.), for example:
- chwri-constitution.pdf
- chwri-governance-charter.pdf
- chwri-code-of-conduct.pdf

These are linked from the "Governance & Institutional Documents" section
on /publications. Update the `governanceDocuments` array in
src/app/publications/page.tsx so each entry's `file` path matches the
filename you drop in this folder, and set `available: true`.
